{"id":"n58785-1-7","stage":3,"title":"벨 · 铃","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n58785-1-7-1","ko":"승규야, 벨이 울리는 걸 보니 누가 왔나 보구나.","zh":"承奎，看门铃响了，应该是有人来了吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"승규야,","meaning":"承奎","explanation":"승규：承奎；야：呼格助词，用来称呼关系亲近的人或晚辈。","readings":[{"term":"승규야","audio":"/audio/7df699add291e5b9b746.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"벨이","meaning":"铃，电铃","explanation":"벨：铃，电铃；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"벨","audio":"/audio/da7f28bccc9c68d58558.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58785","senseId":"1","lemma":"벨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"울리는","meaning":"鸣","explanation":"울리다：鸣；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"울리다","audio":"/audio/c85644d57a245a82d303.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26702","senseId":"3","lemma":"울리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"걸","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实。；ㄹ：을/를 的缩略，标记宾语，如 뭘＝무엇을。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"보니","meaning":"推测","explanation":"보다：推测；니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"20","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"누가","meaning":"谁","explanation":"누구：谁；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"누구","audio":"/audio/e9e6266b8035d7c474ee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62078","senseId":"1","lemma":"누구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"왔나","meaning":"来，来到","explanation":"오다：来，来到；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；나：表示疑问或推测内容，常与 보다、싶다 等合用。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"1","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"보구나.","meaning":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","explanation":"보다：看来、好像（根据情况推测）；구나：对新发现或新理解的情况表示感叹，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62249","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"da7f28bccc9c68d5","term":"벨","zh":"铃，电铃","audio":"/audio/da7f28bccc9c68d58558.mp3","entryId":"58785","definition":"利用电力使其发出声音的一种装置。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"c85644d57a245a82","term":"울리다","zh":"鸣","audio":"/audio/c85644d57a245a82d303.mp3","entryId":"26702","definition":"钟或铃等发出声音。","pronunciation":["울리다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事物、现象或事实。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某种事物、现象或事实。","pronunciation":["거"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"推测；看来、好像（根据情况推测）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"根据某事判断。","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"e9e6266b8035d7c4","term":"누구","zh":"谁","audio":"/audio/e9e6266b8035d7c474ee.mp3","entryId":"62078","definition":"指不认识的人。","pronunciation":["누구"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"来，来到","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"从别的地方移动到这个地方。","pronunciation":["오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/f701cd328d7ad3c30ba2.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n58785-1-7-2","ko":"네, 제가 나가 볼게요.","zh":"好的，我出去看看。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"네：是，行","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"2","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"제가","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나가","meaning":"去","explanation":"나가다：去；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"나가다","audio":"/audio/961ee88770fe6ab5a409.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71456","senseId":"8","lemma":"나가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"볼게요.","meaning":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","explanation":"보다：试着做（-아/어 보다）；ㄹ게요：向对方礼貌地表达自己的决定或承诺。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"25","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1c0ddfd005093840","term":"네","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3","entryId":"17294","definition":"用于肯定回答长辈所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["네"]},{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"44506","definition":"说话人在听话人面前对自己的谦称。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"961ee88770fe6ab5","term":"나가다","zh":"去","audio":"/audio/961ee88770fe6ab5a409.mp3","entryId":"71456","definition":"因有目的而去某处。","pronunciation":["나가다"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/89e325726623527b1cf7.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.956,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=58785","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":107,"sequenceScore":2.7827,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["好的，我出去看看。","苹果真好吃啊。","承奎，看门铃响了，应该是有人来了吧。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["好的，我出去看看。","承奎，看门铃响了，应该是有人来了吧。","苹果真好吃啊。"],"answer":0}]}
